{"id":"775a56acaa867972","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-sub-characterization.md","title":"满子类型的子对象刻画","display":"thm-subobject-fibration-characterization — 满子类型的子对象刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-sub-characterization","aliases":["16-thm-sub-characterization","16-thm--sub-characterization"],"display":"thm-subobject-fibration-characterization — 满子类型的子对象刻画","depends_on":["[[16-df-subset-type]]","[[16-df-unique-choice]]","[[16-df-very-strong-equality]]","[[16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal]]","[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]"],"review_status":"resolved-source-and-construction","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J10","review_date":"2026-10-16","source":"Theorem4.9.4 pp.307–308 (PDF327–328); full construction checked","revision_date":"2026-10-20","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-reviewed; local-interface-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-sub-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-sub-characterization</span><span>16-thm--sub-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-subobject-fibration-characterization — 满子类型的子对象刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"92bb081cf777d22b\" href=\"?note=92bb081cf777d22b\" title=\"16-df-subset-type\">16-df-subset-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cca2b066cf07f3e7\" href=\"?note=cca2b066cf07f3e7\" title=\"16-df-unique-choice\">16-df-unique-choice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f2143c499aae70cc\" href=\"?note=f2143c499aae70cc\" title=\"16-df-very-strong-equality\">16-df-very-strong-equality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d2e1d180cc0ebd2e\" href=\"?note=d2e1d180cc0ebd2e\" title=\"16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal\">16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"resolved-source-and-construction"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J10"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"source","html":"Theorem4.9.4 pp.307–308 (PDF327–328); full construction checked"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-reviewed; local-interface-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}\">\\(\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}\">\\(\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VStrongEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{VStrongEq}\\)</span> 采用直接依赖中的定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\">\\(\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\\)</span>；纤维序记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_I\">\\(\\le_I\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinLim}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinLim}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 有有限极限时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\">\\(p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a>。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubEquiv}_\\chi(p)\">\\(\\mathsf{SubEquiv}_\\chi(p)\\)</span> 是通过规范理解比较刻画的纤维等价性质，定义与断言一并给出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 对 Hom 的作用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{X,Y}\">\\(\\chi_{X,Y}\\)</span> 取全部交换方块；箭头范畴与此作用采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dfea0d23e394e93b\" href=\"?note=dfea0d23e394e93b\" title=\"16-df-full-comprehension\">16-df-full-comprehension</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SubEquiv}_\\chi(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal B)\\land\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\\n\\chi_{X,Y}:\\mathcal E(X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathcal B^\\to(\\pi_X,\\pi_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall m:J\\rightarrowtail I)\n(\\exists X\\in\\mathcal E_I)\\ [\\pi_X]=[m],\\\\\n\\mathsf{SubEquiv}_\\chi(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)\\land\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}(p,\\chi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SubEquiv}_\\chi(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal B)\\land\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\\n\\chi_{X,Y}:\\mathcal E(X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathcal B^\\to(\\pi_X,\\pi_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall m:J\\rightarrowtail I)\n(\\exists X\\in\\mathcal E_I)\\ [\\pi_X]=[m],\\\\\n\\mathsf{SubEquiv}_\\chi(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)\\land\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}(p,\\chi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>J10 重建。原稿的 VeryStrongEq、FullComp、UniqueChoice 只是未接实际定义的名称，且把逻辑纤维化的强假设混入原书定理。本页采用原书 Eq-fibration 与选定子类型结构；FullComp 保留真正的理解函子参数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubEquiv}_\\chi\">\\(\\mathsf{SubEquiv}_\\chi\\)</span> 是规范理解比较满忠实且逐纤维本质满射的显式判据，不以未定义的“等价”名称掩盖构造。</p>\n<p>正向构造（右侧推出左侧）：很强相等与子类型给出基底等化子：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v:I\\to J\">\\(u,v:I\\to J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)}\">\\(\\pi_{\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)}\\)</span> 正是等化子；结合已有有限积得到有限极限。规范比较 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(X)=(pX,[\\pi_X])\">\\(P(X)=(pX,[\\pi_X])\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(f)=pf\">\\(P(f)=pf\\)</span>；理解方块给函子性，笛卡尔方块给纤维性。满子类型使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 满忠实。给任意单态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:J\\rightarrowtail I\">\\(m:J\\rightarrowtail I\\)</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\times J\">\\(I\\times J\\)</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_m=\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1,m\\pi_2)\">\\(G_m=\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1,m\\pi_2)\\)</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 单且相等很强，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_m\">\\(G_m\\)</span> 单值。唯一选择给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\Sigma_{\\pi_1}G_m\">\\(S=\\Sigma_{\\pi_1}G_m\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{G_m\\}\\cong\\{S\\}\">\\(\\{G_m\\}\\cong\\{S\\}\\)</span>。对角子类型定理和理解换基给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{G_m}\">\\(\\pi_{G_m}\\)</span> 同构于图箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle m,\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle\">\\(\\langle m,\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\pi_S]=[m]\">\\([\\pi_S]=[m]\\)</span>。这给每个子对象的原像；满忠实性将其作用延伸到箭头，逐纤维等价随之成立。</p>\n<p>反向：已定义判据直接给满子类型。通过每个纤维的满忠实且满射比较，将有限积、重索引和对角相等伴随运输到子对象纤维化；理解比较保持这些结构（Lemma4.6.2），相等伴随唯一到同构，故相等谓词对应对角子对象，得到很强相等。子对象中单值关系的第一投影是单态射，按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"cca2b066cf07f3e7\" href=\"?note=cca2b066cf07f3e7\" title=\"16-df-unique-choice\">16-df-unique-choice</a> 的证明有存在值与可逆比较；运输回去即唯一选择。预序等价只要求同构类上的逆，不假定全局字面逆或额外全局选择。</p>\n<p>来源陈述与两方向证明已核对。原书 Theorem4.9.4 的证明中将 unique choice 的前置命题误印为 Proposition4.9.3，实际是4.9.2；本页使用实质证明而非沿用编号笔误。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-subset-type","status":"resolved","id":"92bb081cf777d22b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subset-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-unique-choice","status":"resolved","id":"cca2b066cf07f3e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-unique-choice]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-very-strong-equality","status":"resolved","id":"f2143c499aae70cc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-very-strong-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal","status":"resolved","id":"d2e1d180cc0ebd2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-equality-sub