16-df-unique-choice]] 的证明有存在值与可逆比较；运输回去即唯一选择。预序等价只要求同构类上的逆，不假定全局字面逆或额外全局选择。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VStrongEq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinLim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SubEquiv}_\\chi(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{X,Y}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SubEquiv}_\\chi(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal B)\\land\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\\n\\chi_{X,Y}:\\mathcal E(X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathcal B^\\to(\\pi_X,\\pi_Y)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall m:J\\rightarrowtail I)\n(\\exists X\\in\\mathcal E_I)\\ [\\pi_X]=[m],\\\\\n\\mathsf{SubEquiv}_\\chi(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)\\land\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}(p,\\chi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SubEquiv}_\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"u,v:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)}","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"P(X)=(pX,[\\pi_X])","display":false},{"tex":"P(f)=pf","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"m:J\\rightarrowtail I","display":false},{"tex":"I\\times J","display":false},{"tex":"G_m=\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1,m\\pi_2)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"G_m","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\Sigma_{\\pi_1}G_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\{G_m\\}\\cong\\{S\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{G_m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle m,\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"[\\pi_S]=[m]","display":false}],"bytes":4105,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-subset-type]]、[[16-df-unique-choice]]、[[16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal]]、[[16-thm-sub-characterization]]、[[16-thm-split-replacement]]。分裂替代采用与其断言一致的文件名；其结论是纤维等价与指定分裂的构造。"}],"outgoing":["92bb081cf777d22b","cca2b066cf07f3e7","f2143c499aae70cc","d2e1d180cc0ebd2e","6c23c06c4d297e8d","fc49efccd7348d66","b75e7c168ac56b22","dfea0d23e394e93b"]}